    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like healing. it just feels like i'm heavy. like i'm just consuming resources and oxygen that a better person could be using. how can i \"make amends\" when just existing feels like a constant insult to the people i failed? i feel like a parasite.",
