    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you say that, but it feels so delusional. how can i \"fix my life\" when the damage is already done? it's like i'm carrying a debt that can't be repaid. honestly, sometimes it feels like the only way to actually stop being a burden and make things right is to just... stop being here. to just let go so someone else can have the room. doesn't that make more sense than trying to pretend i can ever be \"good\" again?",
